 "text": " Me and my kid are rebooting the Jaws series. Here's every plot from Jaws 5 to Jaws 10. If you've been following along, you know about the shock caves, you know about the radioactive shocks, you know about the Russian Nucleus sub. And Police Chief Brody, played by Pedro Pascal, just stole that sub and he's headed to Russia. Let's go. For the first time ever, Police Chief Brody is leaving the United States. They sail all the way to Leningrad. American soldiers dressed up as Russians. Plus, that one Russian guy who speaks Russian so the Russians don't know what's up. Police Chief Brody sneaks into the freaking Kremlin and he hears Soviet leader Brezhnev, played by Bill Belichick, explain the plan. And the plan is, make every American scared to go in the water. Nobody joins the Navy. Nobody joins the Coast Guard. And then America, protected by an ocean, becomes defenseless overnight. Russia, achieving naval superiority, wins the Cold War. Brody knows he can't communicate this from inside Russia. He's gotta get out. So, CIA officer Rob Gronkowski smuggles him and Chief Oceanographer Jesse, played by Jesse Blemons, out the back of a truck across the border to Finland onto a plane home. The Russians were just starting with Amity Island, but next it's gonna be the whole United States. And there's one remaining problem, which is that the plan is still in motion. And there's only one man who can stop it. Police Chief Brody. And that sets us up for Jaws 9.",
